00000CDF: TEXT 079A 00 00 80 - - 08F4 0019 00AD 0257 00DC 00A3 0019 ; TEXT line=0x079A voice=0x00 flags=0x00,0x80 "Ohhh ... It's you , Commander ..."
00000CF5: TEXT 079A FF 20 80 - - 0248 02ED 0019 08F9 08FD 0019 ; TEXT line=0x079A voice=0xFF flags=0x20,0x80 "Oh no ... Her again ..."
00000D09: TEXT 079A 04 00 80 - - 0903 024B 0165 0906 012F 0911 0257 08FD 00DC 0915 0019 0199 07A0 0669 091E 012F 0925 0257 092C 0019 ; TEXT line=0x079A voice=0x04 flags=0x00,0x80 "AH ! How delightful to see you again , sweeties ... I so much wanted to invite you along ..."
00000D39: TEXT 079A 06 00 80 - - 0932 0199 026D 0936 093B 012F 0941 00B2 0946 0019 ; TEXT line=0x079A voice=0x06 flags=0x00,0x80 "But I didn't know where to send the invitations ..."
00000D55: TEXT 079A 06 00 80 - - 01E3 03A6 03AE 00DC 0257 0911 0019 0952 024B 0952 024B 0952 024B 0956 0959 0391 0019 0952 024B 0952 024B 0952 024B ; TEXT line=0x079A voice=0x06 flags=0x00,0x80 "I'm getting married , you see ... Hee ! Hee ! Hee ! To darling MIGRATOR ... Hee ! Hee ! Hee !"
00000D8B: TEXT 079A FF 20 80 - - 01D1 0961 0019 096E 0973 0019 ; TEXT line=0x079A voice=0xFF flags=0x20,0x80 "Holy homeostatics ... Poor guy ..."
00000D9F: TEXT 079A 07 00 80 - - 0977 03BE 00C1 097D 0329 03CE 00B2 03D1 03D5 03FC 0019 00AD 0985 00C1 098A 0996 00DC 0257 0936 0019 099C 00DC 00B2 09A0 09A6 0866 0329 024B ; TEXT line=0x079A voice=0x07 flags=0x00,0x80 "We're giving a concert here at the BIG BAND CLUB ... It's such a fashionable place , you know ... Why , the whole galaxy'll be here !"
00000DDF: TEXT 079A 08 00 80 - - 09B0 09B4 0430 012F 0866 09BE 09C8 0630 00B2 09CB 09CE 02E7 00B2 09D7 09E0 ; TEXT line=0x079A voice=0x08 flags=0x00,0x80 "Our concert's going to be broadcast by all the TV stations in the universe !!"
00000E05: TEXT 079A 09 00 80 - - 01E3 07A0 09E3 00DC 00A3 0019 0952 024B 0952 024B 0952 024B ; TEXT line=0x079A voice=0x09 flags=0x00,0x80 "I'm so famous , Commander ... Hee ! Hee ! Hee !"
00000E25: TEXT 079A FF 20 80 - - 0199 0611 09EA 09EF 09F7 09FC 0A01 0A0B 0019 0417 0996 0A10 0A14 0A17 00FD 00B2 0A1B 0A21 0019 ; TEXT line=0x079A voice=0xFF flags=0x20,0x80 "I can't help wishing we'd gone somewhere else ... This place has an end of the world feel ..."
