0000121E: TEXT 079A 01 00 80 - - 065B 09E0 0050 0257 0056 03CE 0BE9 00DC 00A3 0019 0BEE 0BF9 036A 0257 0019 ; TEXT line=0x079A voice=0x01 flags=0x00,0x80 "Ah !! There you are at last , Commander ... Everyone's waiting for you ..."
00001244: TEXT 079A FF 20 80 - - 01D1 0C01 033F ; TEXT line=0x079A voice=0xFF flags=0x20,0x80 "Holy handstands !!!"
00001252: TEXT 079A 02 00 80 - - 0C0C 07A0 0C14 0019 01BA 0B25 0315 00B2 036E 0AF3 00DC 00A3 01CF ; TEXT line=0x079A voice=0x02 flags=0x00,0x80 "MIGRA's so worried ... You do have the wedding band , Commander ?"
00001274: TEXT 079A FF 20 80 - - 0C1C 0019 057F 0315 0634 0262 00DC 0C21 0C26 0019 ; TEXT line=0x079A voice=0xFF flags=0x20,0x80 "Yeah ... We have your ring , Miss Burner ..."
00001290: TEXT 079A 04 00 80 - - 04DC 09E0 0758 0C2D 0C38 0C3C 0092 0329 01CF 02EA 09E0 0199 0C42 01BE 0A7C 03CE 0898 036E 0019 ; TEXT line=0x079A voice=0x04 flags=0x00,0x80 "WHAT !! That cybernetic sex fiend is here ? No !! I don't want him at my wedding ..."
000012BE: TEXT 079A 05 00 80 - - 0C48 0C4D 0422 0C58 033F 0199 0611 04A0 03AE 00BC 0A7C 0C60 0010 033F ; TEXT line=0x079A voice=0x05 flags=0x00,0x80 "He's definitely not invited !!! I can't get married with him ogling me !!!"
000012E2: TEXT 079A FF 20 80 - - 04DC 02D6 006C 0C67 0C6B 0C6F 0010 0019 0366 0257 0C78 0C7E 0645 04A0 0656 00BC 013D 00DC 00A3 01CF ; TEXT line=0x079A voice=0xFF flags=0x20,0x80 "WHAT ??? The old bag insulted me ... Are you gonna let her get away with that , Commander ?"
00001312: TEXT 079A FF 20 80 - - 0C82 0C86 00DC 0257 0C67 0C8B 024B 0019 0019 ; TEXT line=0x079A voice=0xFF flags=0x20,0x80 "Get lost , you old sow ! ... ..."
0000132C: TEXT 079A 08 00 80 - - 0C8F 09E0 0C93 0C97 0C97 0019 0A52 0019 0391 0019 0C9B 024B 0199 0CA0 0257 0019 0C93 0C97 0C97 0019 ; TEXT line=0x079A voice=0x08 flags=0x00,0x80 "SOW !! BOO HOO HOO ... MIGRA ... MIGRATOR ... Come ! I need you ... BOO HOO HOO ..."
0000135C: TEXT 079A FF 20 80 - - 02B3 07A0 0CA5 00DC 00A3 0019 ; TEXT line=0x079A voice=0xFF flags=0x20,0x80 "She's so gross , Commander ..."
